        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p>This resolution expresses (1) the sense of the House of Representatives that the sermon given at the National Prayer Service on January 21st, 2025, at the National Cathedral was a display of political activism, and (2)&nbsp;that the House condemns the message of&nbsp;Right Reverend&nbsp;Mariann Edgar Budde.</p>",
